![Evolution X](https://github.com/Evolution-X-OnePlus-15/manifest/raw/bq2/Banner.png)

# Initialize local repository
```
repo init -u https://github.com/Evolution-X-OnePlus-15/manifest -b bq2 --git-lfs
```

# Sync up
```
repo sync -c -j12 --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

# Build

- Set up the build environment
```bash
. build/envsetup.sh
```

- Lunch a target
```bash
lunch lineage_infiniti-bp4a-userdebug
```

- To start compiling
```bash
m evolution
```
